    "The script's result is substituted by the debug hold, so this shows what the route does with each result over the arranged screens, not that Logic reaches any of them.",
    "One menu (Navigate), one window the server did not open (the Step Input Keyboard), one fixture, one Logic installation, one run.",
    "Window names are kept out of this record; the evidence file beside it holds them.",
    "In the ten-language run at the same head and binaries (evidence/2026-10-02-942-post-leaf-settlement.json), the English dialog and menu-over-dialog holds each needed a second Escape at the dialog: escape_targets dialog, dialog and menu, dialog, dialog. Both settled with nothing left, within the three Escapes the settlement allows, but those two checks failed on their exact-count predicate. This English rerun and sixteen probe samples in English and Korean (eight each, with and without a settle delay) closed the dialog on one Escape in 0.18 to 0.24 s; the second Escape was not reproduced."
